; Exercise 3: the same grammar, with the longer alternative tried first.
; It is a rule of its own, MORE, so that when it fails its RETURN winds
; the tape back, and the short alternative starts where it did.
;
;   <list> ::= <adj> <list> | <adj>

        CALL    PHRASE
        STOP
PHRASE  CALL    LIST
        FALSE   P9
        CALL    NOUN
P9      RETURN
LIST    CALL    MORE
        TRUE    L9
        CALL    ADJ
L9      RETURN
MORE    CALL    ADJ
        FALSE   M9
        CALL    LIST
M9      RETURN
ADJ     MATCH   BIG
        TRUE    A9
        MATCH   BAD
A9      RETURN
NOUN    MATCH   BEAR
        RETURN
